            "review_title": "Review at Cô Nin - Bún bò & Bò Kho",
            "review_text": "Wanderer67436500590\n3 contributions\n0\nWonderful beef noodle shop and beef stew\nAug 2026 • Couples\nClean space, beautiful and stylish decor, rich and authentic Hue-style bun bo flavor, clear broth, delicious and rich beef stew with a hint of spice, very eye-catching and appetizing, with extremely delicious salt coffee and sugar tea 😍😍😍. I ate very deliciously, very cleanly. Cute staff, enthusiastic service\n\nThe space is clean with beautiful, tasteful decor. The Bún bò (Hue beef noodle soup) has a rich, authentic Hue flavor with crystal-clear broth. The beef stew is absolutely delicious, flavorful, slightly spicy, visually appealing, and mouthwatering. The salt coffee and iced sweet tea are also exceptionally good! 😍😍😍 I had a fantastic and spotless dining experience. The staff is super cute and provides very attentive service.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten August 20, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
